### Six Cities REST API — sample requests
###
### Run server first: `npm start` (or `npm run start:dev`).
### These requests use VS Code / IDE "REST Client" extension syntax. Adjust @host as needed.

@host = http://localhost:3000

### --------------- USERS ---------------

### Register a new user
# @name register
POST {{host}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex",
  "email": "alex+demo@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty1",
  "type": "pro"
}

### Login (not implemented yet — returns 501)
POST {{host}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex+demo@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty1"
}

### Upload an avatar (multipart/form-data)
### Replace :userId with a real id from the register response above ({{register.response.body.id}}).
### `< ./mocks/avatar-sample.png` reads the file body from disk (REST Client syntax).
POST {{host}}/users/{{register.response.body.id}}/avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SixCitiesBoundary

------SixCitiesBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./mocks/avatar-sample.png
------SixCitiesBoundary--

### Fetch the uploaded avatar (static)
GET {{host}}/upload/<replace-with-returned-filename>


### --------------- OFFERS ---------------

### List offers
GET {{host}}/offers

### List offers with custom limit
GET {{host}}/offers?limit=5

### Premium offers in Paris
GET {{host}}/offers/premium/Paris

### Get one offer
GET {{host}}/offers/{{register.response.body.id}}

### Create a new offer
POST {{host}}/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Beautiful loft in Paris center",
  "description": "Spacious renovated loft in the heart of Paris with great views.",
  "city": "Paris",
  "previewImage": "img/loft-01.jpg",
  "images": [
    "img/01.jpg", "img/02.jpg", "img/03.jpg",
    "img/04.jpg", "img/05.jpg", "img/06.jpg"
  ],
  "isPremium": false,
  "type": "apartment",
  "bedrooms": 2,
  "maxAdults": 4,
  "price": 300,
  "goods": ["Breakfast", "Towels"],
  "host": "{{register.response.body.id}}",
  "location": { "latitude": 48.85661, "longitude": 2.351499 }
}

### Update an offer
PATCH {{host}}/offers/<offerId>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 350,
  "isPremium": true
}

### Delete an offer
DELETE {{host}}/offers/<offerId>


### --------------- COMMENTS ---------------

### List comments for an offer
GET {{host}}/offers/<offerId>/comments

### Create a comment
POST {{host}}/offers/<offerId>/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Great apartment, really enjoyed my stay!",
  "rating": 5,
  "author": "{{register.response.body.id}}"
}


### --------------- FAVORITES (not implemented yet, 501) ---------------
GET {{host}}/favorites

POST {{host}}/favorites/<offerId>

DELETE {{host}}/favorites/<offerId>
